{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我开门。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0213", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好好，拜托你了。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我回来了，欢迎回来。”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0214", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我回来了，欢迎回来。那我去把买的东西放进冰箱喔。”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一起做。”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0215", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "开始在结女上学后接触各种女孩子的机会增加了，不过到了假日基本上还是跟樱乃在一起。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是三连休第二天，我陪她出门购物。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“假日葛格一直都在，好轻松。”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0216", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈。如果隼太有空的话，我或许就跟他去哪里玩了。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太学长，合并试办开始后就很忙。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0217", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对，毕竟他有担任职务。所以我也不好约他。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过，就算不是那样，这个三连休我也打算陪着樱乃喔。”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么？”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0218", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“比如便当之类的，越来越麻烦你了。”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0219", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那当然是体贴，但不是只有那样。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "开始习惯结女的生活后，我反倒越来越感受到樱乃这女孩温柔体贴的一面。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像点餐时料理还附赠味噌汤的这种高兴。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有一个能够轻松、自然相处的人在，真的是一件很宝贵的事。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，我想帮忙她表达这份感激。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，都放进去了。”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有什么事要做我都会帮忙喔。”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“晒的衣服，差不多干了。”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0220", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，那一起收进来折衣服吧。”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0221", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为樱乃也无条件接纳我，所以我就能更放松地跟她相处。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她刚才说“有葛格在很轻松”──对我来说也是一样的。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，走吧。”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔。”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0222", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从樱乃的房间走到阳台，我们分头取下晒干的衣服。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "平常是樱乃来我的房间比较多，所以我很久没进樱乃的房间了。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“？”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0223", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没什么，想说樱乃的房间也好干净。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有其兄必有其妹。”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0224", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……说的也是。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──这一点，跟有没有血缘关系完全无关呢。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是从小时候就一直生活在一起的时光让我们成为兄妹。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……呃，虽然樱乃是觉得我们是真的兄妹才这样说的吧。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不愧是我妹妹。”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不愧是葛格的妹妹。”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0225", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎么说，我们毫无疑问是兄妹。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且感情很要好。大概我们对彼此来说都是像味噌汤的关系吧。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有这样的存在，真的是很高兴的事呢。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来折吧。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0226", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好～”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“分一半。”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0227", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那这一堆就麻烦樱乃喔。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“接下了。”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0228", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们坐在地板上，开始一起折衣服。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“内裤、内裤，葛格的内裤……”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0229", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呃，不用特地说出来吧。”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算是兄妹，这样说出口还是会害羞的。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然平常我也是让樱乃帮我折内裤……", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像很开心的样子。”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为葛格的内裤，我还挺喜欢的。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0230", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我好像听见妹妹说出奇怪的发言！", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“又大、又舒服，好像可以套在头上……折折。”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0231", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等、等一下，不要套啦！”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃的话好像真的做得出来……", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她基本上是个情绪平淡又冷静的女孩，但动不动又会说出惊人的话。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会套，但是想穿看看。”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0232", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她高高举起折到一半的我的内裤。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……跟女孩子的内裤比起来，好像很舒适。”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0233", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真好。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0234", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算你说真好，我、我很困扰……！”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍不住看了一眼衣服堆中樱乃的内裤。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "的确，跟四角裤比起来，那件很贴身很紧的样子……", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可、可是，女孩子那里没有多长一根，所以贴身也没关系吧？", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我到底在思考什么……", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好、好了好了，继续折吧！”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“盯……”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0235", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还是想穿看看。”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0236", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不行！”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“相对的，葛格也可以穿我的。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0237", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“被男人穿了会松掉啦！”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然觉得问题不在这里，但一时之间我也想不到怎么回应她。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系。”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0238", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系吗？”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“旧的就给你。”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0239", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "问题真的不是在这里……", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“条纹内裤跟绑绳内裤，选你喜欢的。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0240", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她真的拿出旧内裤了！", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不用啦你把内裤收好！”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这样啊。”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0241", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“条纹内裤就算了，绑绳内裤没办法套头嘛。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0242", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我才不会穿也不会套！”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好可惜……折、折……”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0243", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嘴里说着可惜，樱乃继续折我的四角裤。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃的那种发言真的让身为哥哥的我很困扰。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……？”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0244", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "注意到我的视线，樱乃停止动作抬起头。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然不让我穿，但你想要穿看看？”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0245", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不对不对不对！”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不管怎么样，跟樱乃相处好放松真好。”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟其他女孩子绝对不会有的对话，跟樱乃的话，我没有半点压力。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "综合所有因素，她是我觉得全世界相处起来最轻松的女孩子。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这就是我的妹妹，樱乃。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 4, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0246", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 5, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不愧是妹妹。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0247", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃很罕见地灿烂一笑，点点头。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 7, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我是葛格的空气。”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0248", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算没有特别意识依然会呼吸。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前有气喘的我，很明白能够无意识地正常呼吸是多么奢侈的事情──", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……说地也是，今后也麻烦你了。”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 11, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我会的。”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0249", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以樱乃的比喻我觉得很到位。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比我刚才想到的味噌汤更沁入心脾。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 14, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格也是。”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0250", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我会的。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 16, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“让我穿内裤。”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0251", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂！”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 18, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“被凶了。”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0252", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然这样说，但樱乃感觉很愉快地继续折衣服。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在外面不能说那种话喔。”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 1, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没问题。”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0253", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃点点头。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 3, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为是葛格才有趣。”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk0254", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不要太戏弄哥哥喔。”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过在某种意义上这或许也是哥哥的特权吧。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
